00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:06.549
Weren't even doing anything yet.

00:02:06.549 --> 00:02:12.330
Imagine the insanity of talking about let's
open it back up when 30 states haven't yet

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:14.040
